	<div align=justify><font class="storytext"><P class=text>Movie star <B>Sean Penn</B> has no regrets about his marriage to <B>Madonna</B> and still <STRONG>thinks the pop superstar is a wonderful person, reports IMDB.com.</STRONG></P>
<P class=text>Now happily married to actress <B>Robin Wright Penn</B>, the "Mystic River" star says of his volatile relationship with the Material Girl: "It was a miserable marriage, but I like her a lot.</P>
<P class=text>"I <EM>describe that marriage as loud . . . I don't recall having a single conversation in four years of marriage</EM>. <EM><STRONG>I've talked to her a couple of times since</STRONG>, <STRONG>and there's a whole person there. I just didn't know it."</STRONG></EM></P>
